        "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
        "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
        "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
        "revision": 1368881366,
        "heading": "Toxicity",
        "text": "H. lupulus can cause dermatitis to some who handle them. It is estimated that about 1 in 30 people are affected by this.",
        "truncated": false
      }
    }
  },
